OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBright
OL,6,Fintervals and a few showers during the
OL,7,Fevening. A cloudy night with patchy
OL,8,Frain or drizzle but becoming mainly
OL,9,Fdry towards Inverness and Speyside.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FA rather cloudy day but some
OL,12,Fbright intervals breaking through at
OL,13,Ftimes. There will also be the odd
OL,14,Fpassing light shower.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,17,Fwith long sunny spells on Monday and
OL,18,Fbecoming a little warmer. Mainly dry
OL,19,Fon Tuesday and Wednesday but perhaps
OL,20,Fsome showers at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
